      <div class="slide__inner slide__inner--tricky" data-reveal data-fade>
        <span class="tricky">sed, ut perspiciatis unde !!</span>
        <HandArrow name="Arrow4" class="tricky__arrow" width={62} />
        <h2 class="da-h">dolor sit amet, consectetur<br /><em class="accent">adipiscing elit</em> sed do eiusmod<br />tempor incididunt ut labore.</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 3. Accountant's side ============ -->
    <section class="slide slide--lead">
      <div class="slide__inner" data-reveal data-fade>
        <h2 class="da-h">Ut ad<br /><span class="accent">Veniam</span> quis,</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="story">
      <div class="story__text" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p><span class="accent">Person Six</span> (lorem ipsum) dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod</p>
      </div>
      <Panel>
        <Video class="media" src={v('kzSYmaHDHwtkf7JIto8g9diIiw')} width=3010 height=1838 label="Placeholder video showing the first step of the flow" />
      </Panel>

      <div class="story__text" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p>Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus: error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque <strong>laudantium totam rem</strong>, aperiam eaque ipsa <strong>ab illo inventore</strong> veritatis quasi?</p>
        <p>Nemo enim ipsam, voluptatem quia voluptas sit aspernatur, aut odit aut fugit,<br />sed quia <strong>consequuntur magni dolores eos ratione</strong>.</p>
        <p><span class="accent">Ipsum in <strong>lorem sit amet.</strong></span></p>
      </div>
      <Panel>
        <Video class="media" src={v('kfDD2llVHcAQPd8Re6cnyrFD30')} width=2486 height=1518 label="Placeholder video showing a form being filled in, a note added and a message composed for the next step" />
      </Panel>

      <div class="story__text" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p>Neque porro quisquam est qui, dolorem ipsum quia dolor, <strong>amet consectetur</strong> adipisci velit sed quia non, aut <strong>numquam</strong> eius modi tempora incidunt magnam.</p>
      </div>
      <Panel>
        <Video class="media" src={v('lRybdZOWniwjFqeBhjrdFIMeoI')} width=2466 height=1518 label="Placeholder video showing a tracked item: setting a reminder and assigning it to a teammate" />
      </Panel>
    </div>

    <!-- ============ 6. Client's side ============ -->
    <section class="slide slide--lead">
      <div class="slide__inner" data-reveal data-fade>
        <h2 class="da-h">Sed, quia dolor<br /><span class="accent">ut labore</span> magnam</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="story story--client">
      <div class="story__text story__text--wide" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit. Amet consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod, tempor incididunt ut labore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam. Quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi.</p>
        <p>Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit voluptate. Velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla, pariatur excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat.</p>
      </div>
      <Panel variant="phone">
        <Video class="media media--phone" src={v('XuzaPjV9ZQcJb3kA0KHD8s8beg')} width=776 height=1702 label="Placeholder video showing a person answering a question from a notification" />
      </Panel>

      <div class="story__text" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p>Person Seven lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur elit.</p>
        <p>Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error. Sit voluptatem accusantium, doloremque.<br />Laudantium totam rem. <span class="accent">Ipsum in <strong>10 seconds</strong>.</span></p>
      </div>
      <Panel variant="plain">
        <img class="media media--watch" src="/assets/images/f9TGXBmePwEmpwV3xZTTW6LsYLc.png" alt="Placeholder smartwatch screenshot showing a “Lorem ipsum dolor” prompt with three generic placeholder response options" width="442" height="496" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </Panel>

      <div class="story__text story__text--wide" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p>Nemo enim ipsam voluptatem quia, voluptas sit aspernatur aut odit aut fugit. Sed quia consequuntur magni dolores, eos qui ratione "voluptatem sequi", nesciunt neque porro quisquam est qui dolorem ipsum quia.</p>
        <p>Neque porro quisquam est qui dolorem ipsum quia dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing.</p>
      </div>
      <Panel variant="phone">
        <Video class="media media--phone" src={v('H1BTGZZAe2hDJhMXUlAAgRKMwQ')} width=702 height=1532 label="Placeholder video showing a person choosing an option, tapping a fallback, and reviewing more pending items" />
      </Panel>

      <div class="story__text story__text--narrow" data-reveal data-fade>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua enim ad minim veniam.</p>
      </div>
      <Panel>
        <img class="media" src="/assets/images/ni1rS3onvwMrh70qAhqrp564LSM.png" alt="Placeholder dashboard screenshot with a detail panel open: a response has been submitted and is ready for approval" width="3456" height="2112" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </Panel>
    </div>

    <!-- ============ 8. closing ============ -->
    <section class="outro">
      <h2 class="outro__h" data-reveal data-fade>Lorem ipsum dolor sit<br />amet consectetur adipiscing elit, sed<br />do eiusmod.</h2>
      <ul class="outro__card" data-reveal="up" data-fade>
        <li>Lorem ipsum dolor sit? <span class="accent"><strong>Consectetur adipiscing.</strong></span></li>
        <li>Sed do eiusmod tempor? <span class="accent"><strong>Incididunt ut labore et dolore.</strong></span></li>
        <li>Magna aliqua enim? <span class="accent"><strong>Ad-minim.</strong></span></li>
        <li>Veniam quis? <span class="accent"><strong>Nostrud exercitation &lt;30 seconds.</strong></span></li>
        <li>Ullamco laboris nisi aliquip? <span class="accent"><strong>Ex ea commodo consequat.</strong></span></li>
